        <pb facs="0001.xml"/>
        <ab>
          <stamp><lb/>DEPOT LEGAL<lb/>Finistère<lb/></stamp>
        </ab>
        <ab><milestone unit="column" n="1"/><lb/>BLOAVEZ 8.</ab>
        <ab><milestone unit="column" n="2"/><lb/>Miz Du 1911</ab>
        <ab><lb/>Rummen 9.</ab>
        <ab><lb/>Kelaouengelch<lb/>MizIEk<lb/>Krouet da veza eun ëre<lb/>ETRE AR VRETONED<lb/>KERAEZ</ab>
        <ab><lb/>«Kaz an den<lb/>ha na gar ar Vro<lb/>a vag anezan »<lb/>Sant KADO.</ab>
        <figure type="decoration"/>
        <figure type="decoration"/>
        <p rend="heading"><lb/>Rener F. Jaffrennou “Taldir</p>
        <p><lb/>Eur Rummen : 2 wennek.Eur bloaz: 6 real Gant AR BOBL: 20 real</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article">
        <head><lb/>Krennad</head>
        <p rend="labelled"><lb/>Klemgan nn Dilezet, Jos Par-<lb/>ker ; Hor c’harantez, Eostik Ke-<lb/>An abardaez, Potr ar<lb/>rinek ;<lb/>C'hap; Anaon hon mignoned,<lb/>Taldir.</p>
        <p rend="labelled"><lb/>Roll-Geriadur ar Voraërien,<lb/>Stourmer.</p>
        <p><lb/>Geriadur Gallek ha Brezonek<lb/>(Taldir).</p>
        <figure/>
        <pb facs="0002.xml"/>
        <milestone unit="page" n="34"/>
        <ab><milestone unit="column" n="1"/><lb/>« Inouet eo va c'halon, va ene touellet,<lb/>Siouaz! va dousik koantik eun all a n’euz laeret !»</ab>
        <p rend="heading"><lb/>Klemgan an Dilezet</p>
        <figure type="decoration"/>
        <list>
          <item>« Eostik kuz ô kana enn noz steredennet, Eostik, kanit klemmus, va c’houlmik zo nijet!»</item>
          <item>« Kemer va dorn, kamarad, ha deuz eun abaden ; Gant eun dro danz, hepdale, vo trec’het an anken. »</item>
        </list>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>« Kemer eur vestrez leal gant furnez arc'hantet,</l>
          <l><lb/>Na zougo seiz na velouz, na koef dantelezet. »</l>
        </lg>
        <list>
          <item>« Va bue zo kommoulet gant an devalijen, Levenez va daoulagad zo eat deuz va c’hichen!»</item>
          <item>« Kemer eur plac'h duadez pe melen, na vern ket, Vit goelia peb karantez al loar a zo kuzet. »</item>
        </list>
        <p rend="styled"><lb/>Kergoadik, gwengolo 1911.</p>
        <ab><milestone unit="column" n="3"/><lb/>Jos PARKER.</ab>
        <figure type="decoration"/>
      </div>
      <div type="article">
        <head><lb/>Hor c'harantez</head>
        <figure type="decoration"/>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Da ofern eur pardon</l>
          <l><lb/>E kleviz he mouezig,</l>
          <l><lb/>Dous vel mouez eun evnig</l>
          <l><lb/>O tibuna e zon</l>
          <l><lb/>E sioulder ar c'hoad don.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Diwar neuze dalc’hmad</l>
          <l><lb/>Am eus bet he c’hlasket...</l>
          <l><lb/>Nan, n’ankounac'hin ket</l>
          <l><lb/>Pebeuz sell eon ha mat</l>
          <l><lb/>A gouez diouz he lagad.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>N’ouzoun ket he hano,</l>
          <l><lb/>Hag he c’haran meurbed.</l>
          <l><lb/>Holl verc'hed all ar bed</l>
          <l><lb/>A gavfen divalo:</l>
          <l><lb/>Nemeti n’am bezo.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>— Hag eun huvre gwirion</l>
          <l><lb/>Am eus bet huvreet :</l>
          <l><lb/>Hep dale vo skoulmet</l>
          <l><lb/>Da viken diou galon</l>
          <l><lb/>Mignonez ha mignon.</l>
        </lg>
        <ab type="head"><lb/>D'am fried.</ab>
        <figure type="decoration"/>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Hogen eur warc'hoaz a deuio</l>
          <l><lb/>Hag hor yaouankiz a deuzo ;</l>
        </lg>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Met na c’hano ket an devez</l>
          <l><lb/>Ma ehano hor c’harantez.</l>
        </lg>
        <list>
          <item>— Eun deiz eur bez a zigoro : Unan ebarz a ziskenno ;</item>
        </list>
        <lg>
          <l><lb/>Met biken nerz yen ar maro</l>
          <l><lb/>Hon diou garantez na dorro.</l>
        </lg>
        <list>
          <item>— Ar bez a vo digoret c’hoaz Evit unani gwreg ha goaz ;</item>
        </list>
        <list>
          <item>Ha diouz hor bez, hor c’harantez A zavo beo d’eun eil buez.</item>
        </list>
        <ab><lb/>Eostik KERINEK.</ab>
        <ab><lb/>Boharz</ab>
